{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":18.96},{"sectionId":"build","start":20.52,"end":35},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.84,"end":46.4}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.88,"text":"標題可能包含 <、> 與 & 等字元。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.24,"end":4.72,"text":"在 HTML 中，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.96,"end":7.04,"text":"它們可能改變頁面結構。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.84,"end":8.72,"text":"html."},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.846,"end":12.16,"text":"escape 會把它們轉為文字實體。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.04,"end":16.16,"text":"資料進入標記時才進行跳脫，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":16.32,"end":18.96,"text":"不要把完成的 HTML 文件整份跳脫。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":20.52,"end":21.52,"text":"在 /chapter3."},{"sectionId":"build","start":21.813,"end":23.36,"text":"py 用 escape(..."},{"sectionId":"build","start":23.72,"end":25.12,"text":") 包住 project[\"title\"]。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":26,"end":30.28,"text":"執行後檢查預覽是否按原樣顯示 <draft> 與 &。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":31.92,"end":35,"text":"這個樣板中哪個值需要跳脫？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.84,"end":38.76,"text":"這個樣板中哪個值需要跳脫？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.44,"end":43.2,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":43.92,"end":46.4,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}